  "body": "Build your future in one of Orewa's most desirable communities with this exciting House & Land Package in sought-after Ara Hills. Situated on a 300m² section, this package is based on a thoughtfully designed 130m² home concept featuring three bedrooms, two bathrooms, an internal-access garage, and a separate lounge. Designed with modern family living in mind, the layout offers the perfect balance of comfort, functionality, and style. Enjoy spacious open-plan kitchen, dining, and living areas that create a natural hub for family life, while excellent indoor-outdoor flow makes entertaining effortless. The master suite includes a private ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, providing a comfortable retreat at the end of the day. Located just minutes from Orewa Beach, schools, cafés, shopping amenities, and motorway access, Ara Hills offers the perfect blend of coastal living and everyday convenience. \r\n\r\nPackage Features \r\n• 3 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | Internal-Access Garage \r\n• Separate lounge for additional living space \r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining & living \r\n• Master suite with ensuite & walk-in wardrobe \r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow \r\n• Modern family-friendly design \r\n• Stamford Insurance included \r\n• Prime Ara Hills location close to beaches and amenities \r\n\r\nWhy Choose a House & Land Package? Secure your section today and enjoy the opportunity to build a brand-new home tailored to your lifestyle. The advertised package is based on the proposed home design shown. With flexible design options and upgrade opportunities available, you can personalise your home while enjoying the confidence that comes with building new.\r\n\r\nFrom section to dream home – create a home that's uniquely yours. \r\nPrice: From $948,000 Home design, layouts, and upgrade options can be tailored to suit your needs. \r\n\r\nVisit our Showhome at 49 Ara Hill Drive, Orewa, to explore the possibilities",
